      "structure_description": "The discrete double-shell cluster has an inner arrangement of 22 Gd(III) ions and an outer arrangement of 22 Ni(II) ions. The article describes two Gd5Ni2 subunits and two Gd6Ni9 subunits joined alternately through DTA, hydroxo, and sulfate bridges."
